<wire x1="0" y1="0" x2="30" y2="0" width="0" layer="20"/><wire x1="30" y1="0" x2="30" y2="49.2" width="0" layer="20"/><wire x1="30" y1="49.2" x2="0" y2="49.2" width="0" layer="20"/><wire x1="0" y1="49.2" x2="0" y2="0" width="0" layer="20"/><hole x="28" y="2" drill="2"/><hole x="28" y="47.2" drill="2"/><hole x="2" y="24.6" drill="2"/><hole x="7" y="4.8" drill="1"/><circle x="8" y="8.4" radius="0.4" width="0" layer="46"/><circle x="8" y="24.6" radius="0.4" width="0" layer="46"/><circle x="8" y="40.8" radius="0.4" width="0" layer="46"/><circle x="15" y="8.4" radius="0.4" width="0" layer="46"/><circle x="15" y="24.6" radius="0.4" width="0" layer="46"/><circle x="15" y="40.8" radius="0.4" width="0" layer="46"/><circle x="22" y="8.4" radius="0.4" width="0" layer="46"/><circle x="22" y="24.6" radius="0.4" width="0" layer="46"/><circle x="22" y="40.8" radius="0.4" width="0" layer="46"/><text x="1" y="47.7" size="0.8" layer="51">COVER x2 (same part, flip) FR-4 0.4mm 2L (Top L1 = INNER face facing core; Bottom L16 = OUTER face: pads)</text><text x="1" y="46.2" size="0.8" layer="51">heater transverse zigzag 0.20/0.20 in 1.6 band inside channel, L=1135 mm, ~8.5 Ohm @1.4mOhm/sq+0.6</text><text x="1" y="44.7" size="0.8" layer="51">circles L46 = sensor ports blind 0.8 dia x 0.3 deep from OUTER face; port hole = PORT 1.0 dia = INLET when used as bottom cover; flip the same part about the x-axis -> hole lands at channel end = NOZZLE insert (top cover)</text><text x="1" y="43.2" size="0.8" layer="51">2 vias phi0.3 (pad 0.7) at channel start/end = INSIDE sealed cavity -> MUST be solder-filled at reflow. Outer face (L16): force pads F at y 4.8/44.4 + Kelvin sense pads S at y 3.2/46.0 (4-wire heater R(T)). SAME PART for top and bottom cover (flip about x-axis).</text>
</plain>
